OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry with some sunshine   
OL,6,Ftoday. Cloudier at times across the    
OL,7,FWestern Isles, northern Sutherland and 
OL,8,FCaithness with the odd light shower.   
OL,9,FLight northerly wind.                  
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.     
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry 
OL,13,Falthough clouding over at times across 
OL,14,Fthe east. Cold with a widespread frost.
OL,16,CSunday:FAll parts will have a dry and  
OL,17,Fcold day with some spells of sunshine. 
OL,18,FBrisk southeasterly wind across Barra. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
